# Baselines captured on an Apple M-series development machine in release builds.
# Budgets deliberately leave 50-100% headroom for hosted-runner variance while still
# catching an algorithmic regression. Update the baseline after intentional performance
# work; increase a budget only with a measurement explaining why.

